message: >-
  If you use HOVSS-PQ, its source code, datasets,
  experimental results, or evaluation framework,
  please cite this research repository and the
  associated scientific publication when available.

type: software

title: >-
  HOVSS-PQ: Human-Verifiable Visual Secret Sharing
  through a Modular Framework for Post-Quantum
  Authentication and Device-Independent Integrity
  Verification

abstract: >-
  HOVSS-PQ is a modular research framework for
  investigating human-verifiable visual secret sharing,
  post-quantum issuer authentication, and
  device-independent integrity verification.
  The repository provides experimental implementations,
  datasets, mathematical validation artifacts,
  adversarial security evaluations, optical reconstruction
  experiments, synthetic-observer benchmarks, and
  reproducible research results. The framework evaluates
  confidentiality, reconstruction correctness, content
  integrity, digital authentication, and perceptual
  reliability as distinct security properties.
  It provides a foundation for future development
  and validation rather than claiming a fully secure
  end-to-end optical authentication protocol.

